  'finale:actor:finale_wolf_champion': 'PROPOSAL, to confirm: the same elite champion of the Wolf clan as the one already drawn for the Dragon’s peaks, whose sprite he fights with at the Tournament: a closed iron helm with a crest of wolf’s ears that hides the face, a wolf pelt over the shoulders, chain mail, dark blue cloth, several throwing blades: short throwing knives at his belt and on a bandolier across the chest, one held in hand. No long sword.',
