  'finale:enemy:demon_champion': 'PROPOSAL, to confirm: the Serpent’s champion changed into a demon, no longer a man, huge and hunched, twice his former bulk: a body of hard, matte hide black like cold ink has burst out of his armour, and only two or three broken plates of dark bronze on one shoulder and a torn shred of his deep green mantle still cling to him; his serpent-crested helm is split open with no face inside, only darkness and two cold white eyes; long arms ending in great black claws, his weapon. The black hide shows no glowing cracks: no fire, no lava, no orange or red glow anywhere on him. No blade any more, no weapon in hand. Never purple, violet or magenta.',
  'finale:enemy:breach_demon': 'PROPOSAL, to confirm: one of the demons that come out of the breach, belonging to no clan: a lean, hunched creature the height of a man, long-limbed, on two clawed feet, its hide black like cold ink and dripping at the edges as if not yet set, two short curved horns of dull bone grey, no face at all but two small cold white eyes, long black claws on its hands, its weapon. No armour, no clothing, no weapon in hand, no banner or emblem. Never purple, violet or magenta.',
